      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SpringDataJacksonConfiguration.PageModule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>SpringDataJacksonConfiguration.PageModule</code></a> for the given <a href=\"SpringDataWebSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>SpringDataWebSettings</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"SpringDataWebSettings.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.web.config 中\"><code>SpringDataWebSettings</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"SpringDataJacksonConfiguration.PageModule.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.web.config 中\"><code>SpringDataJacksonConfiguration.PageModule</code></a>。",
