    {
      "source": "A Jackson module customizing the serialization of <a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a> instances depending on the\n<a href=\"SpringDataWebSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>SpringDataWebSettings</code></a> handed into the instance. In case of <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#DIRECT\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.DIRECT</code></a> being\nconfigured, a no-op <code>StdConverter</code> is registered to issue a one-time warning about the mode being used (as\nit's not recommended). <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#VIA_DTO\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.VIA_DTO</code></a> would register a converter wrapping <a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a>\ninstances into <a href=\"../PagedModel.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PagedModel</code></a>.",
      "translation": "Jackson 模块会根据传入实例的<a href=\"SpringDataWebSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>SpringDataWebSettings</code></a>自定义对<a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a>实例的序列化方式。如果配置了<a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#DIRECT\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.DIRECT</code></a>，则会注册一个无操作的<code>StdConverter</code>以发出一次关于所使用模式的警告（因为该模式不推荐）。若配置为<a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#VIA_DTO\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.VIA_DTO</code></a>，则会注册一个转换器，将<a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a>实例封装为<a href=\"../PagedModel.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PagedModel</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
